{"id":"665336","name":"海带豆腐汤","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/665336/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"海带","amount":"50g"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"10g"},{"name":"姜","amount":"10g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"海带备用。","img":"images/665336/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"先将海带用温水泡发，洗净。","img":"images/665336/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切成菱形片。","img":"images/665336/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"豆腐备用。","img":"images/665336/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将豆腐洗净，切成大块，放入锅内加水煮沸。","img":"images/665336/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出后，放入盘中。","img":"images/665336/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"改刀切成块。","img":"images/665336/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切好的葱花和姜末，备用。","img":"images/665336/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅置火上，倒入适量油烧热，放入姜末、葱花煸香，放入豆腐块、海带片，加入适量清水，大火烧沸，加入盐改用小火炖10分钟，待到海带、豆腐入味时出锅即可。","img":"images/665336/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盛入盆中即食。","img":"images/665336/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"美味健康营养汤。","img":"images/665336/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}